{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105613","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105613/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105613/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105613/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105613","id":3007847408,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6TRLvF","number":105613,"title":"Fix incorrect transform when editor camera is moved externally","user":{"login":"ryevdokimov","id":105675984,"node_id":"U_kgDOBkx80A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105675984?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov","html_url":"https://github.com/ryevdokimov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-04-21T08:01:21Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T12:37:29Z","closed_at":"2025-04-28T00:27:05Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105613","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105613","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105613.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105613.patch","merged_at":"2025-04-28T00:27:05Z"},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n\r\nRelated: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11424#issuecomment-2817938811\r\n\r\nWhen modifying the global transform directly the result ends up being wrong. The method `_apply_camera_transform_to_cursor()` didn't fully deconstruct the externally modified transform for the cursor data that would be used to transform the camera when the update for it is called. \r\n\r\nIt is not applying the cursor / z distance to the position of the cursor.\r\n\r\nNote how the camera is translated here:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/2d3bdcac35ac22ee6c4d5d5edc88ba947d0659d5/editor/plugins/node_3d_editor_plugin.cpp#L627-L640\r\n\r\nAdditionally, interpolation is removed when modified externally because it is unnecessary (or can be done externally) and leads to minor inaccuracies. \r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bd676a9e-5884-4e6b-b04e-2e992c7d0c5d\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f8c02e8e-f537-4bd7-bea6-f4b98331eabd\r\n\r\n\r\nHow to test:\r\n\r\nDownload Zylann `Editor Debugger` addon and enable it:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cfcb8be2-b8c8-405f-91c4-7d376433977d)\r\n\r\nCheck `Show in Inspector`: \r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3ed7cb43-244f-46ef-b0ed-8f69c22c72dc)\r\n\r\nUse the addon's `F12` functionality to select the 3D viewport (this will select a `Control` node which is on top), then navigate from there to the `Camera3D` node.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8952160c-fb65-42dd-81d3-0866a1a919da)\r\n\r\nOpen the inspector and manipulate the Camera's transform. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105613/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105613/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}